t Villa with Private Pool\"\n- Has 4 images (lines 203-206)\n- Is associated with host `a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111`\n\n### Root Cause Analysis\n\n**The code chain is working correctly.** The \"Property not found\" error occurs when:\n1. The API returns a 404 response (property not in database), OR\n2. The fetch fails for some reason\n\nGiven that the test file (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/image-gallery.spec.ts`) explicitly uses this property ID and expects it to exist, the issue is likely **not in the code logic** but rather:\n\n- **Database connectivity issue**: The API function successfully connected to the database and executed the query, but the property didn't exist in the database at test runtime\n- **Seed not executing**: The `truncateAndSeed()` function runs in `beforeAll()` but may have failed silently\n- **Test environment**: The tests may be running against a different database instance than expected\n\n**Files involved:**\n- /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx (routing)\n- /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/PropertyDetail.tsx (page component)\n- /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/properties.ts (API endpoint)\n- /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify.toml (API routing configuration)\n- /repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts (database seeding)"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a1feb0492d1f31380 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 41593\ntool_uses: 22\nduration_ms: 30355</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6d86e976-1032-4e20-b927-fb9bc4791925","uuid":"62df5e18-4041-4f84-820b-fc0b376ab1d6","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"In /repo/apps/AirbnbClone, find:\n1. The property detail page component (the route that handles /properties/:id)\n2. The API endpoint/netlify function that fetches a single property (likely in netlify/functions/)\n3. The router configuration\n\nI need to understand why navigating to /properties/b2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222 shows \"Property not foun