[2026-03-15T23:35:20.340Z] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_016SXFknxtn66WxWZEHPrAq2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Tests still fail due to the pre-existing netlify function execution issue (`connect ECONNREFUSED` in function invocation). This is a systemic infrastructure problem with `netlify dev` v24.2.0 on this ARM64 environment - all functions that try to execute fail, regardless of the app code.\n\nLet me summarize what was done:\n\n## Summary\n\n### Subtask 1: FixViolation - ImageGallery caption display\n\n**Problem**: The ImageGallery component used image captions only as `alt` text on `<img>` elements. The test spec requires captions to be displayed as visible text (tested via `toContainText()`).\n\n**Fix** (`src/components/ImageGallery.tsx`):\n- Added a visible `<span>` overlay with the caption text on the main image (lines 47-51)\n- Added a visible `<span>` overlay with the caption text on each thumbnail (lines 69-73)\n- Captions are displayed with a semi-transparent black background for readability\n\n### Subtask 2: RunTests - Tests could not be verified\n\n**Infrastructure fix** (`scripts/test.ts`): Added `writeEnvValue`/`removeEnvValue` helpers to write `DATABASE_URL` to `.env` so netlify dev functions can access it (previously only passed via process env which netlify dev ignores for functions).\n\n**Blocker**: All image-gallery tests fail due to a pre-existing systemic issue where `netlify dev` v24.2.0 cannot execute Netlify Functions on this ARM64 environment. The function bootstrap throws `connect ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:<random_port>` for every function invocation. This affects ALL tests that require API calls, not just the image-gallery tests.\n\n<DONE>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":442,"cache_read_input_tokens":134501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":442,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_t